{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-13",
  "title": "在尘或血中",
  "storyCode": "15-14",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e6fd15ee4d05e0cebb46fa0b9c9d45c66e579dc006c2e49ac9fb5279251f0ab6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "已选择“怀旧金曲”......\n恢复上次播放进度——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——我的爱~♪\n吹散了山丘前的樱花——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Friston-3，现在不是唱歌的时候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "你以为我想吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的播放组件是被自定义的，遥控器又不在我手上——\n该死的可露希尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "煌，注意正义骑士号！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "可露希尔到底把我的代码同步功能放在哪个子菜单里了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——把女孩子最珍重的眼泪献给你~♪\n请替我保留——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "小猫，我的背后，正义骑士号瞄准我了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "挡住了，唔，差点伤到正义骑士号——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "好痛，不许再撞我了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异常的THRM-EX",
      "text": "（炙热地撞撞)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异常的THRM-EX",
      "text": "炽，炽热——Boom......mmmmmmmmm——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——不管是谁~♪\n充满爱意的窃窃私语都是一生一次的陷阱——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈哈，那我们就比比谁的燃烧更火热一些，THRM-EX！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "啊......不要真伤害到小车们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我当然有数！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异常的Castle-3",
      "text": "保、保护伙伙伙伴——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异常的Lancet-2",
      "text": "你需要治疗，Friston-3。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "呼，这时候还是得感谢可露希尔为我装配了能量防护发生器——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——呀，我最爱的人就在这里~♪\n你在我的眼泪中闪耀着光芒——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Friston-3，还需要多久！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "同步模块准备好了，但是这些源石我跳不过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我替你搭路，就是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston-3加速冲上了跨越障碍的高坡，飞跃到了空中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在空中旋转的时候，他情不自禁地抛下了一张照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "（哈，真是好久......没有这样活动了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "（你大肆夸耀的同频传输系统最好有效，可露希尔......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "两位，把这几辆昏了头的车引到特定的轨道上来，然后控制住他们，我会让他们恢复正常！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——献给你~♪\n这份我一直深藏在心中的爱——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "连上了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空旷的沙漠中依旧隐隐回荡着刚刚的歌声。\n——献给你~♪\n这份我一直深藏在心中的爱——♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "毫无疑问，播放组件故障了，可露希尔最爱的煽情音乐开始一遍又一遍地播放，好像这是一个多么催人泪下的场合。\n而他要在此时，向几辆连自主意识都没有的智能小车，分享那场注定离别的梦境，分享自己作为人的，最深藏的回忆。\n特雷弗·弗里斯顿有点想要破口大骂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "......这里是什么地方——刚刚我们好像被关在一个、关在一个......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "怎么会什么都记不起来——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正义骑士号”",
      "text": "“滴滴”，发现异常目标！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正义骑士号”",
      "text": "你是谁？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "text": "逼自己好好想想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "text": "可露希尔可是说过你们一个个都聪明得不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "text": "这个语气......你、你是Friston-3！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "text": "但是Friston-3可没有你这么高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "text": "不，他就是Friston-3！我能从他身上感受到熟悉的温度——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "text": "温度......我怎么没法感受自己的温度了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿",
      "text": "唉，头疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "这样或许你们能够更好受些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "这里是哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "我的梦，一个对我来说同样是惊喜的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "安静点听我说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "PRTS出了点问题，我大概能猜到发生了什么。你们的认知模块受到了扭曲，到处大搞破坏，我只能出手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正义骑士号”",
      "text": "听不懂，“滴滴”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "简单来说，我正用自己的核心代码覆写你们的底层代码。当然，我会保证你们的记忆模块完全照旧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "这会花上点时间，为了让你们在这期间能够安分一会儿，我不得不把你们的思维模组暂时与我的相连接。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "副作用就是......*未知语言粗口*，我会情不自禁地分享我的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "到底发生了什么，Friston-3？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "我的一位故人快从长眠中苏醒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "别想了，不然你们的脑子又要过载。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "你们现在要做的，就是在结束之前，陪我走走。聚会快开始了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金发的女孩在张灯结彩的营地中欢快地舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "THRM-EX",
      "text": "是派对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "不......是婚礼。我女儿的婚礼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "我们不过去吗，Friston-3？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "就在这里看看就好，我不想过去。过去就意味着我会再一次——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "你在悲伤？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "......你能感觉到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "欸，当然。我们不是一样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Castle-3",
      "text": "你说有人扭曲了我们的认知模块，那为什么你要帮助我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "哪儿有那么多原因。刚才Lancet-2不是说了，我们是一样的......起码现在，起码在罗德岛上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "在这艘船上的生活很平静，我谈不上喜欢，但比起那个永远没有结果的梦，那些夭折的未来，它没那么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "没那么坏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特雷弗·弗里斯顿听到了女儿熟悉的笑声。\n一场他注定会错过的婚礼，一个他不得不爽约的邀请。只要他不再靠近，她或许就永远不会从他的眼前走开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "......代码覆写完成。各位，该回家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他一刻也不愿意停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "罗德岛......怎么变成了这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "欸，Friston-3，他们都已经恢复了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "暂时如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "我覆写了目前他们所有代码中与PRTS相关的部分，用我的核心代码来保证他们的基本运作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "太好了，小猫，这下我们可以放心去支援Misery他们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "Friston-3，接下来你要去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "和这几位刚刚清醒过来的家伙商量一下，我想我们多少还能帮上点忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "可露希尔那边我会沟通。我还准备找她算账呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "阿米娅，似乎小车们的状态已经暂时恢复正常了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "弗里斯顿先生的状态如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "呃，除了有点生我的气，其他都还挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "嘿嘿，多亏他想到能借助他的核心代码直接覆写与PRTS相关的底层代码，否则还真挺棘手的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......可露希尔小姐，如今我们拥有的PRTS权限已经全部失效？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "恐怕是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "PRTS主动屏蔽了我们所有人对其的访问，如今它的所有运行都在黑箱中完成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "虽然凯尔希在试图争夺其控制权，但我担心她也没法坚持太久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "强制切断PRTS的核心能源。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "text": "强制切断核心能源意味着我们必须直接进入Abyss内部，这一计划的风险很大。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "那我会保护博士。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "而且，我们并非孤身作战，精英干员们都站在我们的身后。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "text": "我不会放弃博士，也不会放弃罗德岛。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "强制启动备用系统争夺本舰控制权。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "text": "我的ZOOT系统并不能完全做到与PRTS争夺控制权。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "text": "我与凯尔希进行过此种情况的演算。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
